# Home Food Deli CLI — secrets. Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored.
# Your personal API token from app.homefooddeli.co.za → Profile → API access.
# This is the ONLY secret. Load it before running hfd:  set -a; source .env; set +a
HFD_TOKEN=hfd_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# NOTE: the Supabase anon key/URL in types.go are PUBLIC (they ship in the web app's
# JS bundle) and are safe to commit — they are not secrets, so they are not here.
